    "narrativeEn": "Donatella Ferrante won a 3–2 decision against Jenny Lundberg at Hammarby’s international boxing gala.\n\nDino Studio · 16 November 2024 · Eriksdalshallen, Stockholm\n\nDonatella Ferrante defeated Jenny Lundberg by a 3–2 decision in the women’s senior 60 kg bout at Bajen Rough House in Eriksdalshallen. The international boxing event was organised by Hammarby on 16 November 2024.\n\nLundberg, representing Narva BK, faced Ferrante of Roma Boxe as part of the programme bringing Stockholm boxers and Italian opponents together. Hammarby’s subsequent event report lists Ferrante as the winner of their closely scored contest and names her the gala’s best visiting boxer.\n\nThe organisers scheduled preliminary bouts from 13:00 and the elite programme from 17:00. Alongside the contests against Roma, the card included local matchups against Djurgården and further preliminary bouts.\n\nHammarby reported more than 900 spectators for the event. The overall team meeting with Roma ended 4–3 in Hammarby’s favour, decided by Elwin Belezika’s victory in the closing bout. Dino Studio’s photographs focus on Lundberg and Ferrante’s meeting, documenting one of the individual contests within the larger international gala.",
