    "narrativeEn": "The Allsvenskan derby at 3Arena ended in a Hammarby home victory on 19 October 2025.\n\nDino Studio · 19 October 2025 · Stockholm, Sweden\n\nHammarby defeated AIK 2–1 at 3Arena on 19 October 2025 in the 27th round of Allsvenskan. The Stockholm derby brought 27,876 spectators to the stadium for a Sunday fixture that kicked off at 14:00.\n\nAIK’s official match record confirms the date, venue and final score. Granit Maqedonci refereed the match, which ended with the home side taking all three league points.\n\nThe fixture followed AIK’s 3–2 home defeat to IFK Värnamo two weeks earlier. That match was played at Strawberry Arena in Solna; the derby was a separate event at Hammarby’s home stadium in Stockholm. The two sets of photographs therefore belong to different reports and different venues.\n\nDino Studio’s derby photographs accompany this account of Hammarby’s victory. His original post identifies the occasion as a 2–1 win against AIK at 3Arena, consistent with the official record for 19 October. The result and attendance place the images within the late-season Allsvenskan meeting between the city rivals.",
