    "summarySv": "Åhman och Hellvig vann herrtiteln medan Helland-Hansen och Pavlova tog damkronan under Stockholms första Crown Series-event. (1 matchbilder).",
    "narrativeEn": "Åhman and Hellvig won the men’s title as Helland-Hansen and Pavlova claimed the women’s crown at Stockholm’s first Crown Series event.\n\nDino Studio · 29 January 2026 · Avicii Arena, Stockholm\n\nSweden’s David Åhman and Jonatan Hellvig won the men’s title at Queen & King of the Court in Avicii Arena on 29 January 2026. Norway’s Helland-Hansen and Pavlova took the women’s crown as the series opened its season in Stockholm.\n\nThe organisers reported more than 4,000 spectators at the event, staged in the largest venue the competition had used. Åhman and Hellvig secured their fifth crown, establishing a new record for the format.\n\nThe Swedish pair reached 15 points in the decisive men’s round within ten minutes. Austria’s Berger and Hammarberg finished second, ahead of Norway’s Mol and Sørum. Fellow Swedes Hölting Nilsson and Andersson placed fourth.\n\nIn the women’s final, Helland-Hansen and Pavlova pulled away late to finish on 15 points. Finland’s Prihti and Parkkinen were runners-up with six, while Sweden’s Reffel and Thurin took third with five. For Helland-Hansen, the victory brought a first title after more than 15 appearances in the format. Dino Studio’s photographs document the Stockholm competition.",
    "narrativeSv": "Åhman och Hellvig vann herrtiteln medan Helland-Hansen och Pavlova tog damkronan under Stockholms första Crown Series-event.\n\nDino Studio · 29 januari 2026 · Avicii Arena, Stockholm\n\nSveriges David Åhman och Jonatan Hellvig vann herrtiteln i Queen & King of the Court i Avicii Arena den 29 januari 2026. Norges Helland-Hansen och Pavlova tog hem damklassen när serien inledde säsongen i Stockholm.\n\nArrangörerna rapporterade över 4 000 åskådare i arenan. Det svenska paret nådde 15 poäng i den avgörande rundan på under tio minuter och säkrade sin femte titel i formatet. Dino Studios bilder dokumenterar strandvolleybolleventet i Avicii Arena.",
