    "summarySv": "Ett sent mål av Filip Langer avgjorde SM-finalen i innebandy för herrar till Storvretas fördel med 3–2. (20 matchbilder).",
    "narrativeEn": "A late Filip Langer goal sealed a 3–2 victory in the men’s Swedish floorball final.\n\nDino Studio · 25 April 2026 · Avicii Arena, Stockholm\n\nStorvreta IBK won their fourth consecutive Swedish championship with a 3–2 victory over IBF Falun in the men’s floorball final on 25 April 2026. Filip Langer scored the decisive goal late in the third period to settle a closely contested meeting of the rivals.\n\nStorvreta established a two-goal lead before Falun recovered. Sakarias Ulriksson opened the scoring in the first period, and Otto Weidman made it 2–0 early in the second. Emil Lundmark reduced the deficit before Lukas Rosenklint brought Falun level.\n\nThe teams entered the final period tied at 2–2. Langer’s goal, recorded at 17:12 of the third period, put Storvreta back in front, and they protected the advantage through the remaining minutes.\n\nThe result also completed a trophy treble, following Storvreta’s Champions Cup and Svenska Cupen successes during the season. The club confirmed that the championship was its tenth overall. Dino Studio’s photographs accompany this report from the Swedish championship final at Avicii Arena in Stockholm.",
    "narrativeSv": "Ett sent mål av Filip Langer avgjorde SM-finalen i innebandy för herrar till Storvretas fördel med 3–2.\n\nDino Studio · 25 april 2026 · Avicii Arena, Stockholm\n\nStorvreta IBK tog sitt fjärde raka SM-guld efter seger med 3–2 mot IBF Falun i herrarnas innebandyfinal den 25 april 2026 i Avicii Arena. Filip Langer gjorde det avgörande målet sent i tredje perioden.\n\nStorvreta ledde med 2–0 efter mål av Sakarias Ulriksson och Otto Weidman innan Falun kom tillbaka till 2–2. Langers mål vid 17:12 avgjorde finalen och säkrade en trippel för klubben under säsongen. Dino Studios fotografier dokumenterar finaldramatiken och guldjublet i Avicii Arena.",
